{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、ということでですね\nさすがにブログあけすぎて母にも怒られました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/11/13/9043686/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろの手は中田花奈。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えー、まずはノギビンゴ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私ね、だめ人間1位という名をいただいてしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こりゃー...あかんね。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マネージャー、メンバーの皆さんに宣言します、わたし！もう！遅刻は！しません！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たり前だよって話ですはい。\n反省します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えー、来週のノギビンゴはね\nまえにモバメであみが言ってた幸せすぎる出来事とやらが明かされる回でございます。\nよろしく！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから「のぎ天」！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優勝しました私達下北沢チームはご褒美ロケとして、鎌倉と江ノ島に行ってきました(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/11/13/9043686/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チーム下北沢"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/11/13/9043686/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鎌倉ハムを食べて食レポ対決をしたのですが、なんと優里と能條は店員さんに食レポが上手い！と選んでいただき、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご褒美に貴重部位と言われるステーキを食べさせてもらいました❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういうときに何かと選んでもらいやすいの私。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと得だよね(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/11/13/9043686/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後半戦もまだまだ続くので次週もお楽しみに❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/11/13/9043686/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にっこにこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/11/13/9043686/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にっこにこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鎌倉はまたゆっくり遊びに行きたいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと！\nれなちさんにね「永遠の踊り子」と名付けたのは私です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理由ですよね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーとねそれは彼女の日頃の努力をたたえてる証拠です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リハ中とかにね\n黙々と1人で壁に向かってダンスの練習をずっっとやってるんですよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にびっくりするくらいずっと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人一倍負けず嫌いなのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰に言われるでもなく暇さえあれば1人で練習してる姿はまさに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「永遠の踊り子」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、だからあみはそんな頑張り屋なれなちが好き(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなも良ければ是非そう呼んであげてください。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/11/13/9043686/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も収録があるので、\nそろそろ眠ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/11/13/9043686/0007.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}